        <mxCell id="wfV49XsxJHOofvk-cEGl-252" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#ff0000&quot; face=&quot;メイリオ&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;CEFを有効&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;メイリオ&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;（ip cef）&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="132.0036145019531" y="1530.0011450195314" width="180" height="41" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wfV49XsxJHOofvk-cEGl-253" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#ff0000&quot; face=&quot;メイリオ&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;CEFを有効&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;メイリオ&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;（ip cef）&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="530.003614501953" y="1530.0011450195314" width="180" height="41" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wfV49XsxJHOofvk-cEGl-254" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: メイリオ; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;LDPネイバーを確立するためには以下のとおりに設定します。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-family: メイリオ; font-size: medium; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;これにより自動的にLIBテーブルが作成されます。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: メイリオ; font-size: medium; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;LDPのルータIDを指定しない場合、&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: メイリオ; font-size: medium; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;そのルータの一番大きいアドレスの物理インターフェースの&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: メイリオ; font-size: medium; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;IPアドレスがルータIDになります。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-family: メイリオ; font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;Loopbackインターフェースがある場合、Loopback I/FのIPが優先されます。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-family: メイリオ; font-size: medium; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;最後に、MPLS網に参加するインタフェースのみ、MPLSを有効にします。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-family: メイリオ; font-size: medium; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;Loopback I/F での有効化は不要です。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="13" y="1571.01" width="809" height="120.99" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
