        <UserObject label="https://www.cisco.com/c/ja_jp/support/docs/multiprotocol-label-switching-mpls/mpls/13733-mpls-vpn-basic.html#:~:text=BGP-" link="https://www.cisco.com/c/ja_jp/support/docs/multiprotocol-label-switching-mpls/mpls/13733-mpls-vpn-basic.html#:~:text=BGP-" id="wfV49XsxJHOofvk-cEGl-302">
          <mxCell style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;" parent="1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="136.99692749023438" y="3539.003435058594" width="550" height="51" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="wfV49XsxJHOofvk-cEGl-304" value="&lt;pre style=&quot;margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: courier; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; max-width: 97%; overflow: auto; display: block; color: rgb(88, 88, 91); letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: courier; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap; max-width: 97%; overflow: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: courier; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap; max-width: 97%; overflow: auto;&quot;&gt;hostname PE-1&lt;br/&gt;!&lt;br/&gt;ip cef&lt;br/&gt;!&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;!--- VPN Client_A commands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;vrf definition Client_A&lt;br/&gt; rd 100:110&lt;br/&gt; route-target export 100:1000&lt;br/&gt; route-target import 100:1000&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt; !&lt;br/&gt; address-family ipv4&lt;br/&gt; exit-address-family&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;!--- Enables the VPN routing and forwarding (VRF) routing table.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;!--- Route distinguisher creates routing and forwarding tables for a VRF. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;!--- Route targets creates lists of import and export extended communities for the specified VRF.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;  &amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;!--- VPN Client_B commands.  &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;vrf definition Client_B&lt;br/&gt; rd 100:120&lt;br/&gt; route-target export 100:2000&lt;br/&gt; route-target import 100:2000&lt;br/&gt; !&lt;br/&gt; address-family ipv4&lt;br/&gt; exit-address-family&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;! &lt;br&gt;interface Loopback0&lt;br/&gt; ip address 10.10.10.4 255.255.255.255&lt;br/&gt; ip router isis &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;!&lt;br/&gt;interface GigabitEthernet0/1&lt;br/&gt; vrf forwarding Client_A&lt;br/&gt; ip address 10.0.4.2 255.255.255.0&lt;br/&gt; duplex auto&lt;br/&gt; speed auto&lt;br/&gt; media-type rj45&lt;br/&gt;!&lt;br/&gt;interface GigabitEthernet0/2&lt;br/&gt; vrf forwarding Client_B&lt;br/&gt; ip address 10.0.4.2 255.255.255.0&lt;br/&gt; duplex auto&lt;br/&gt; speed auto&lt;br/&gt; media-type rj45&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;!--- Associates a VRF instance with an interface or subinterface. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;!--- GigabitEthernet0/1 and 0/2 use the same IP address, 10.0.4.2. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;!--- This is allowed because they belong to two different customer VRFs.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;!&lt;br&gt;interface GigabitEthernet0/0&lt;br/&gt; description link to P-1&lt;br/&gt; ip address 10.1.1.14 255.255.255.252&lt;br/&gt; ip router isis &lt;br/&gt; duplex auto&lt;br/&gt; speed auto&lt;br/&gt; media-type rj45&lt;br/&gt; mpls ip&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;!--- Enables MPLS on the L3 interface connecting to the P router&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;!&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;router isis&lt;br/&gt; net 49.0001.0000.0000.0004.00&lt;br/&gt; is-type level-2-only&lt;br/&gt; metric-style wide&lt;br/&gt; passive-interface Loopback0&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;!--- Enables IS-IS as the IGP in the provider core network&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;!&lt;br/&gt;router bgp 65000&lt;br/&gt; bgp log-neighbor-changes&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt; neighbor 10.10.10.2 remote-as 65000&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt; neighbor 10.10.10.2 update-source Loopback0&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;!--- Adds an entry to the BGP or MP-BGP neighbor table. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;!--- And enables BGP sessions to use a specific operational interface for TCP connections. &lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;!&lt;br/&gt; address-family vpnv4&lt;br/&gt;  neighbor 10.10.10.2 activate&lt;br/&gt;  neighbor 10.10.10.2 send-community both&lt;br/&gt; exit-address-family&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;!--- To enter address family configuration mode that use standard VPN version 4 address prefixes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;!--- Creates the VPNv4 neighbor session to the Route Reflector. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;!--- And to send the community attribute to the BGP neighbor.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;!&lt;br/&gt; address-family ipv4 vrf Client_A&lt;br/&gt;  neighbor 10.0.4.1 remote-as 65002&lt;br/&gt;  neighbor 10.0.4.1 activate&lt;br/&gt; exit-address-family&lt;br/&gt; !&lt;br/&gt; address-family ipv4 vrf Client_B&lt;br/&gt;  neighbor 10.0.4.1 remote-as 65001&lt;br/&gt;  neighbor 10.0.4.1 activate&lt;br/&gt; exit-address-family&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;!--- These are the eBGP sessions to each CE router belonging to different customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;!--- The eBGP sessions are configured within the VRF address family&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br/&gt;!&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;end&amp;nbsp;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=default;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1138" y="4045" width="993" height="1975" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
